
# SWOT Analysis – UWC Cam Champion

This document outlines the strengths, weaknesses, opportunities, and threats of our project.

---

## Strengths
- Solves a real student problem, it tracks student academic performance
- Includes useful features:
  - Smart goal tracking  
  - What-if simulator  
  - Weakness detection  
- Built using modern technologies such as Spring Boot, React, MySQL
- Helps students improve academic performance
- Scalable for future improvements meaning it will easily add new features or handle more users later

---

##  Weaknesses
- First full-stack project, while we have limited experience
- Some features may be complex to implement
- Requires strong teamwork and coordination
- Limited time due to academic workload
- Database design still evolving

---

##  Opportunities
- Can grow into a real product for students
- Useful for portfolio and internships
- Opportunity to learn full-stack development
- Can add AI features in the future
- Can expand into a mobile app

---

##  Threats
- Team inactivity may slow progress
- Technical challenges and bugs
- Poor time management
- Overcomplicating features
- Existing study apps as competition
